WEBVTT

00:51:27.495 --> 00:51:31.616
but you still think have a rich future.

00:51:31.640 --> 00:51:33.680
Yuval Harari talks
about the useless class,

00:51:33.704 --> 00:51:35.434
that essentially, AIs are going to,

00:51:35.458 --> 00:51:38.831
unless you're super creative
or you can code machines or whatever,

00:51:38.855 --> 00:51:41.132
that you will end up
almost in a useless class,

00:51:41.156 --> 00:51:43.068
where your work is not needed.

00:51:43.092 --> 00:51:46.299
But you have a category
that you call "Human Veneer,"

00:51:46.323 --> 00:51:48.291
which are jobs that aren't that creative,

00:51:48.315 --> 00:51:50.410
but they are supersocial.

00:51:50.434 --> 00:51:55.308
And that you picture AI actually
empowering people

00:51:55.332 --> 00:52:00.555
to enhance their human values
and contribute to society